  "claims": [
    "C1. Independent policy and selected snapshot identity fix the required inventory and dependencies before payload reads. Each missing or changed kind propagates only to its descendants.",
    "C2. The three false ancestry paths disappear and two unaffected paths remain. Old witness replay is independent. Source-qualified occurrence mappings and the ambiguous historical mention can be independently checked.",
    "C3. The release retains exact LD3 artifacts. The covered absence becomes stale, unrelated coverage remains current, and the migration worklist agrees with LD3.",
    "C4. Additive preview refuses the predicate edit. The pinned ordinary preview and apply reproduce. A stale judgment and its renewal use the same source and occurrence. The rule-only control has unchanged vocabulary.",
    "C5. Both current supports bind distinct source occurrences, review evidence, rule and resolution editions. Independently replay each certificate and try removing the other."
  ],
